            <section class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm p-6 md:p-8 mt-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Diğer Politika Haberleri</h2><ul class="divide-y divide-gray-100 text-sm"><li><a href="https://sanatturk.com/haber/erdogan-konaklama-vergisi-indiriminin-bir-yil-daha-uzatilacagini-duyurdu.html" class="flex items-center gap-3 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-800 hover:text-[#721c24]"><img src="https://sozcu01.sozcucdn.com/sozcu/production/uploads/images/2026/11/kabinebuguntoplaniyorgundemdeemeklimaaslarivarkapak982bae133be0ae01jpg-8lZI-ac8PUCvnyV7fH0hlw.jpg?w=1270&amp;h=675&amp;mode=crop&amp;scale=both" alt="" loading="lazy" class="w-20 h-14 object-cover rounded flex-shrink-0" onerror="this.remove()"><span class="leading-snug">Erdoğan, konaklama vergisi indiriminin bir yıl daha uzatılacağını duyurdu</span></a></li><li><a href="https://sanatturk.com/haber/cumhurbaskani-erdogan-gabar-da-135-milyon-varil-petrol-potansiyeli-bulundu.html" class="flex items-center gap-3 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-800 hover:text-[#721c24]"><img src="https://trthaberstatic.cdn.wp.trt.com.tr/resimler/2470000/recep-tayyip-erdoganaa-2471046.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" class="w-20 h-14 object-cover rounded flex-shrink-0" onerror="this.remove()"><span class="leading-snug">Cumhurbaşkanı Erdoğan: Gabar&#x27;da 135 milyon varil petrol potansiyeli bulundu</span></a></li><li><a href="https://sanatturk.com/haber/hasan-ufuk-cakir-imamoglu-nu-hakaret-ederek-tbmm-de-salonu-terk-etti.html" class="flex items-center gap-3 py-3 font-semibold text-gray-800 hover:text-[#721c24]"><img src="https://sozcu01.sozcucdn.com/sozcu/production/uploads/images/2026/11/butce-gorusmeleri-kavga-2026-11-09-1webp-KjaNqHx2IEWqZT3qrjNKUA.webp?w=1270&amp;h=675&amp;mode=crop&amp;scale=both" alt="" loading="lazy" class="w-20 h-14 object-cover rounded flex-shrink-0" onerror="this.remove()"><span class="leading-snug">Hasan Ufuk Çakır, İmamoğlu&#x27;na hakaret ederek TBMM komisyonunu